                                "sense_id": "98c156e4-9dca-39a0-b2c2-efb8a51dabf5",
                                "text": "\"That is the boat of Captain Hyde. What comes he this way for?\"\n\"The river way is free to all, Joanna.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ad84310c-765f-497e-8279-b1ebc9c05f62",
                                "sense_id": "98c156e4-9dca-39a0-b2c2-efb8a51dabf5",
                                "text": "Manhattan was a line of constellations, the riverway a gulf of darkness in which were scattered stars."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8a38787d-f925-4a6a-981e-705d8570699c",
                                "sense_id": "98c156e4-9dca-39a0-b2c2-efb8a51dabf5",
                                "text": "Barge traffic on the country's most important commercial riverway is completely paralysed."
                            },
                            {
